# Host readiness (CapRover action board)

**Canonical instructions live in [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) (section Host readiness / CapRover gates) and [`.cursorrules`](../../.cursorrules).** Claude Code and Codex load those; this file is Cursor convenience only — do not invent a second policy here.

When adding or changing a hosted CapRover gate:

1. Evidence / gap codes → [`src/lib/ops/host-control-evidence.ts`](../../src/lib/ops/host-control-evidence.ts)
2. Action catalog + CapRover placeholders → [`src/lib/ops/host-readiness-actions.ts`](../../src/lib/ops/host-readiness-actions.ts)
3. Title / consequence / gap i18n maps → [`src/lib/ops/host-readiness-copy.ts`](../../src/lib/ops/host-readiness-copy.ts) + `messages/en.json` / `messages/fr.json` under `hub.platformOperator`
4. Run `npm run test:unit -- src/lib/ops/host-readiness-copy.test.ts src/lib/comms/public-copy-style.test.ts`

Never show live secret values on `/app/site-admin/host`. No packet-tracker UI; deeper narrative: [`docs/guides/HOSTED_SECURITY.md`](../../docs/guides/HOSTED_SECURITY.md).
